          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "जगाना — jagānā — \"to wake (someone)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "मुझे सुबह पाँच बजे जगाइए। mujhe subah pā̃c baje jagāiye. Please wake me at five in the morning."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with ने (he or she …): उसने मुझे जल्दी जगाया, usne mujhe jaldī jagāyā."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "जगाना (jagānā) is the causative partner of जागना, from Sanskrit jāgrati, \"are awake\" (CDIAL 5175), which lists Hindi jagānā: you जागना yourself, and you जगाना someone else."
            }
          ]
        },
